D. Future Directions
While our experiments were conducted with models of small parameter size, scaling up the number of parameters would demonstrate new possibilities, in particular on reasoning or planning abilities. Moreover, our framework can be extended to controllable text generation utilizing the guidance methods (Dhariwal & Nichol, 2021; Ho & Salimans, 2022) of continuous
